<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Just a common bush to be,</l><l>Something in which God can dwell,</l><l>Something thru which God can speak,</l><l>Something thru which God can tell.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All His yearning over men,</l><l>All His purposes of love,</l><l>Flaming with no light of earth,</l><l>But with glory from above:</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God Himself within the bush,</l><l>Nothing seen but just the flame;</l><l>Make me that, just that, O God,</l><l>For the glory of Thy Name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
